<object label="1" tooltip="1. Humans write intent: a spec with testable acceptance criteria, a budget, and the boundary the work must stay inside." id="b-0"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="167.5" y="393" width="22" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
<mxCell id="e-1" value="dispatch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=8;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n-crew" target="n-builders"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<object label="2" tooltip="2. The Crew conductor decomposes the spec and dispatches headless Kiro CLI workers, one isolated worktree each." id="b-1"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="437.5" y="393" width="22" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
<mxCell id="e-2" value="PR" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=8;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n-builders" target="n-verify"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<object label="3" tooltip="3. Workers self-verify locally, then open a pull request; CodeBuild runs the verification mesh: tests, property-based tests, mutation score, SAST, secret scan, cost diff." id="b-2"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="689.5" y="393" width="22" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
<mxCell id="e-3" value="merge on green" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=8;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n-verify" target="n-pipeline"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<object label="4" tooltip="4. When every automated gate and an independent AI review pass, the merge queue merges without a human click." id="b-3"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="927" y="393" width="22" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
